# Line endings: LF everywhere — in the repository AND in every working copy,
# regardless of a machine's own core.autocrlf setting (Git for Windows
# defaults it to true, which made Git warn "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on
# every LF file it touched, and left the working tree a mix of both).
# Every tool this project uses (VS Code, Vite, Node, Netlify, GitHub Actions)
# is fine with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
